contentText:
John Calipari may have conquered the world of college basketball, but he says he was too &#8220;intimidated&#8221; to take a shot at talking to Taylor Swift when he had the chance at a New York Knicks game this year.

In a Friday (Oct. 15) interview with CBS Sports College Basketball , the University of Arkansas coach recalled attending game 4 of the NBA Finals at Madison Square Garden and seeing that the pop star was also in the building. &#8220;Taylor Swift was there,&#8221; he said. &#8220;I was embarrassed to go up to her.&#8221;

